BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:📢 Northern: Strike planned\, services may be disrupted
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20261126T120000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20261127T115900
DTSTAMP:20261116T000000Z
UID:7504d0bf4ccd0febadab@tfl-closures
CATEGORIES:Update from TfL's live status (not in the planned closures list
 )
DESCRIPTION:📢 Update from TfL's live status (not in the planned closure
 s list)\n\nTUBE STRIKE: Some London Underground Tube drivers are planning 
 to take strike action from 12:00 Thursday 26 until 11:59 Friday 27 Novembe
 r. There is likely to be some disruption across all Underground lines\, bu
 t trains are expected to run on most lines.\n\nFrom TfL's live status (Spe
 cial Service)\, checked 19 November 2026.\n\nPlans can change. Check befor
 e you travel: https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/\nUnofficial c
 alendar\, not affiliated with TfL.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
END:VEVENT
